{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dwarven Village: Dark Siege TD",
    "steam_appid": 3526560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/a5b70d4507bc5cc7d2ac15fea6f492aa.avif?t=1755616934\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span><strong>GRID BASED</strong>\u00a0<strong>PLACEMENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are able to place dwarfs on the paths and buildings on the sides of paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ARMY</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cards to play before the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIT LEVELS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarfs level up automatically by living &amp; dealing damage &amp; healing, enemies level up by wave and you need to upgrade your buildings to get more resources\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VILLAGE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to work on the &quot;Dwarven Village&quot; by placing &amp; repairing &amp; upgrading towers or houses like item shop or spell house</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GETTING HELP FROM DIFFERENT RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you repair the watchtower in the village you are able to select one race and get help from them by being able to place them on paths &amp; being able to place special towers that belongs to that race.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCREASE YOUR STATS BY BUYING &amp; UPGRADING TOWERS\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can increase your stats by buying &amp; upgrading towers &amp; statues \u00a0or with cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ITEM &amp; CURSE SHOP</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get items and curse cards to get some buffs (some rebuffs when you get curse) for overall stats or specific for units</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/a5b70d4507bc5cc7d2ac15fea6f492aa.avif?t=1755616934\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span><strong>GRID BASED</strong>\u00a0<strong>PLACEMENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are able to place dwarfs on the paths and buildings on the sides of paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ARMY</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cards to play before the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIT LEVELS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarfs level up automatically by living &amp; dealing damage &amp; healing, enemies level up by wave and you need to upgrade your buildings to get more resources\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VILLAGE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to work on the &quot;Dwarven Village&quot; by placing &amp; repairing &amp; upgrading towers or houses like item shop or spell house</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GETTING HELP FROM DIFFERENT RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you repair the watchtower in the village you are able to select one race and get help from them by being able to place them on paths &amp; being able to place special towers that belongs to that race.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCREASE YOUR STATS BY BUYING &amp; UPGRADING TOWERS\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can increase your stats by buying &amp; upgrading towers &amp; statues \u00a0or with cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ITEM &amp; CURSE SHOP</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get items and curse cards to get some buffs (some rebuffs when you get curse) for overall stats or specific for units</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dwarven Village is a tower defense game that you choose your units and fight against orcs with them. Defending, Building, Repairing, Beating &quot;orcs masters&quot;, curses, chest drops are waiting for you!",
